# Reviewer decisions for candidate M1 (Codex pass 0001 claims). Grammar: _tools/build.py docstring.
# M1 ownership headers (first '> ' line of each file): knowledge skills are "Knowledge skill · <X> technique ·
# Policy: <rules>" (angular, dotnet-testing, ef-core add "Technique only"); project-structure and security-scan are
# "Workflow · Owns ... procedure"; logging/references/serilog.md is "Private reference ... Serilog provider technique";
# security-scan/references/scan-layers.md is "Private reference ... Investigation prompts per layer · Prompts are not
# automatic vulnerability declarations; the security invariants they check are owned by .claude/rules/security.md".
# Reviewer convention (same as M): designed trigger predicates of hooks/checkers that an existing group states too
# broadly -> facet; incidental helper/failure edge effects -> NOT_AN_INDEPENDENT_CONSTRAINT.

