appl: actor=post-tool-use hook (Write/Edit/MultiEdit branch); action=emit the add-dependency reminder only when the new text contains PackageReference, PackageVersion or "dependencies"/"devDependencies", or the file is package.json; trigger=direct edit of a manifest; modality=ENFORCED_ADVISORY trigger condition; scope=.csproj, Directory.Packages.props, package.json edits; exceptions=package.json always qualifies; manifest/architecture checks run regardless; timing=after the edit; enforcement=static code read (changedText lines 39-45 ignores old_string), not executed; loading=hook code
